# CLI patterns (`cli.py`)

## Three flavors per stage

1. Flag form (`index`, `download`, …)
2. JSON form (`index-json`, …) — 1:1 onto Pydantic config
3. Base+location form (`*-location-json`, `*-all-location-json`) — merge `base.json` + location JSON

## Adding a new command flavor

This file has ~26 `_build_*_config_from_base_and_location` helpers. **Prefer tab-completion** to extend an existing helper pattern — copy the nearest neighbor, tab through the field list. Avoid agent-generated bulk duplication across all three flavors unless all three are needed.

Dispatch to stage `run()` functions or `get_provider(name)` — do not embed provider logic in CLI wrappers.

## Location paths

`_apply_location_paths_policy` derives `downloads_<slug>`, `rendered_<slug>`, `artifacts_<slug>` from `location_name`.

## Tests

CLI merge/build helpers are heavily tested in `tests/test_cli_json_params.py`. Run targeted pytest after CLI changes.
